    "The model uses a geocentric observer and builtin solar ephemerides, a 0.20 arcsec per-axis systematic error floor, and a 20% angular-speed allowance. Topocentric offsets, light-time dynamics, RA\u2013Dec covariance, calibration systematics, and full gravitational dynamics are not modeled."
